  birdName: Ostrich
  icon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 157cc028f5d53ec45a60ca1cdc5ef408, type: 3}
  description: "Ostrich is 2 meters tall, built like a tank, and the fastest bird
    on land. If not for Ostrich\u2019s nasty temper, they\u2019d already be signed
    to the best bird-ball team in the country."
  offensiveAbility: "Incredible Violence - Ostrich is infused with Rage for 30 seconds.
    While enraged, every point the opposing team scores will increase Ostrich\u2019s
    strength by 1 with a cap at 10, and every point Ostrich\u2019s team scores extends
    the duration of Rage by 3 seconds. (30s cooldown, starting after the end of the
    previous Rage duration)"
  offensiveIcon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: da27aae65636ccb44bc36529c053522f, type: 3}
  defensiveAbility: "Australian - Ostrich is immune to all debuffs (enamor, stun,
    weakness, silence). This does not include environmental effects, such as Pelican\u2019s
    slip fish, Penguin\u2019s snowball, or Chicken\u2019s egg throw. (Passive)"
  defensiveIcon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: bf0f2392d794b8b4da13f85f1c12b22d, type: 3}
  groundSpeed: 7
  jumpForce: 6
  strength: 7
